  "description": "Get emailed when it matters. Critical errors land in your inbox as beautiful HTML alerts — with smart throttling so you never get flooded. Template and SmtpClient cached at startup: zero per-email disk I/O or TCP handshake overhead. ConcurrentDictionary throttle window prevents duplicate alerts under burst load. Zero SMTP library dependencies — uses BCL SmtpClient.",
